  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020010,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020011,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "まあ、焼き芋の味がしますね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "021",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020011"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか。よかった……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020020,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……何それ\r\n美味しいともなんとも言ってないんですが",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん……？\r\nすまん、いまいちだったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020030,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "別に\r\nとても美味しいです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020040,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "いくらでしたか\r\n800円くらい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、気にしないでくれ\r\nこれは差入れだからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020050,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nでも、余計な気遣い無しで",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気持ちとして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020060,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "取引として",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うぐ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020070,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……もうどっちでもいいけど\r\n手間の分も上乗せで払いますので",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった、受け取る\r\nでも手間賃は無しだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020080,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……強情\r\nじゃあ、それで",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "交渉成立……！\r\nすまん、ありがとうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020090,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……\r\nあなたが謝る理由もありませんが",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020100,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "気持ちを押し付けられても、\r\n私は返す気がないので",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020110,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "なるべく受け取りたくない\r\nそれだけです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n受け取る理由があったら違うのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020120,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……まあ、場合により",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、わかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020130,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "わかってないですよね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\nいや、まあ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もう円香からもらったものを、\r\n俺の方が返したかっただけなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "感謝祭も大成功だったし、\r\nありがとう、お疲れ様って伝えたくてさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020140,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……それはどうも",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "SNSの感想とかもみんなにも見てもらえるように\r\nまとめているところなんだけど……ちょっと見るか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020150,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……いえ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、うん……じゃあ、\r\n円香のファンの人たちも喜んでいたことだけ伝えておくな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "特に歌についてのコメントが多かったよ\r\nもちろん、良い内容だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020160,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020170,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "それは歌詞や曲や何かの力で、\r\n私は関係ない",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100202/1021002020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021002020180,
